  unitName: Thunderbird
  unitId: 40092
  unitNumber: 117
  description: A strange bird that lives in valleys enveloped by thunder clouds.
    The reason other creatures can't approach it is that it can control all thunder
    in the valley. It emits lightning when it finds prey, stunning it before it brings
    it back to its nest. Recent studies show that it brings its prey back still alive
    so that its chicks can practice hunting safely.
  summonDesc: Did you call for me, Summoner?<br>I will join you, so quickly, <br>show
    me where to strike!
  fusionDesc: My thunder!!<br>It's even stronger!!
